Package: markovSim
Title: Implements and analyses discrete-time Markov chains using R6 classes.
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Graham", "Dib", , "gd619@ic.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulation for finite-state discrete-time Markov chains. Calculates marginal distributions, empirical distributions, and approximates the stationary distribution. Allows basic analysis through visualisation tools (directed weighted graph plot).
